WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.025
Individuals in a population differ; inherited variation is passed on.

2
00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:09.625
No two beetles are quite the same colour: that's variation.

3
00:00:10.476 --> 00:00:15.101
Colour can take any value from pale to dark: continuous variation.

4
00:00:23.824 --> 00:00:27.749
Colour is inherited, so the survivors' colours are passed on.
